From 9a68fdadf2d981a40078c1b28122c5ced0289156 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brennan Lamoreaux <brennan.lamoreaux@broadcom.com>
Date: Thu, 8 May 2025 21:38:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Introduce FIPS canister plugins

Introduces two GCC plugins to facilitate the interface
between FIPS canister binary and the Linux kernel.

pad_canister_structs: Pads each whitelisted structure
with 8 bytes of padding, to save space for new fields
in the future. Only executed during canister building.

match_canister_structs: Matches layout of structures
in the kernel with the master versions in the FIPS canister.
This consists of matching the order and inserting padding
to match the size. Also can run safeguarding checks
against structure member offsets, size, type, etc.
Not executed during canister building.

Signed-off-by: Brennan Lamoreaux <brennan.lamoreaux@broadcom.com>
